ntial extraction, privilege escalation, and an orchestrator that ran until it got command execution. VAPT was being rewritten stage by stage while the Sysdig TRT watched, and every target was a private practice range. We were looking at a tool in development, before it was potentially turned on real victims.Due to LLMjacking, the Ollama server was free, unauthenticated, and unmetered. For an actor whose tool makes hundreds of model calls per attack, our blog said, "the economics are clear." When the cost of an attack drops to the cost of inference, and inference is stolen, offensive operations become […]

